The reward system must become a real accounting subsystem.

Do not implement fake balances.

Do not increment balances simply because a task was requested.

Do not reward "online" status by itself.

Rewards must be based on verified contribution.

Define a canonical reward pipeline:

Contribution
    ↓
Evidence
    ↓
Validation
    ↓
Eligibility
    ↓
Reward Calculation
    ↓
Reward Record
    ↓
Ledger Entry
    ↓
Balance Projection
    ↓
